               Reprocessing in the Circular Factory",
  author    = "Afifi, Nehal and Mas, Victor and Hemmerich, Jonas and
               Leitenberger, Felix and Hoffmann, Luisa and Darijani, Ali and
               Grauberger, Patric and Heizmann, Michael and Beyerer, J{\"u}rgen
               and Matthiesen, Sven",
  abstract  = "Abstract Circular factories must ensure the functionality and
               reliability of used components for recombination with other
               components or subsystems from the same or different product
               generations. This paper presents a data-driven decision-making
               framework integrating the Functional Behavior Model and System
               Reliability Model within a Digital Twin. Data from physical
               testing is continuously incorporated, simulating recombination
